# Researcher and taps for mana again ({U}{U} in all). Turn 5: Memnite (a creature) attacks and is untapped after combat. The Researcher itself is
# refused as its own target (another), and so are Bot2's tapped Mox Jet and Bot2's own Memnite (you control).

